r() is invoked', 'description': 'Using reflection (or a custom Builder stub) set the private field uriMap to null. Calling getUriTranslator() should throw NPE because URITranslator.map(null) is not allowed. This tests the defensive‑programming branch where uriMap is unexpectedly null.'}]}, {'group': 'NullCompositeURITranslator', 'cases': [{'input': [], 'expected': 'NullPointerException thrown when getUriTranslator() is invoked', 'description': 'Manipulate the private field uriTranslators to be null (e.g., via reflection). The method attempts to call with() on a null reference, resulting in NPE. This verifies behavior when the composite translator is not initialized.'}]}]
